{"id":80,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自然豊かな環境で自立する女性を育む","feature_description":"共立女子第二中学校・高等学校は、落ち着いた環境の中で、学力と人間性を育てる女子校です。中高一貫の授業、行事、探究、部活動を通して、自分で考え行動する力と、他者と協力する姿勢を養います。共立女子学園の教育を土台に、将来に向けて自立して歩む女性の成長を支えています。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1397,"name":"和躾（なごみ）部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1398,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1399,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1400,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1401,"name":"サウンドソサエティ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1402,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1403,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1404,"name":"ハンドメイド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1405,"name":"美術部・漫画研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1406,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1407,"name":"野外研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1408,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/nichukou/school-life/club/